            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides for composite textiles (200; 300) that include a coating layer (220; 320) and a textiles layer (210; 310), and methods of manufacturing composite textiles (200; 300). The coating layer (220; 320) includes a mixture of a polyolefin resin and a thermoplastic vulcanizate (TPV). The coating layer (220; 320) has a level of elongation that is at least 80 percent of the level of elongation of the textile layer (210; 310) without the coating layer (220; 320) present.</p>
            </abstract>
